  "content": "\n\n<h1>Lucid Sky</h1>\n<p>基於原版對天際與天氣進行修改，以呈現更寫實的效果。</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>搭配 <strong>光影</strong> 使用，可獲得更佳的視覺體驗。</p>\n<h3>天體</h3>\n<p>原版 ---&gt; Lucid Sky ---&gt; Lucid Sky + 光影 (MakeUp - Ultra Fast)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b9526bd3db9a52c9d68646876bd5040688755e1a.png\" alt=\"太陽\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e363dbc22bf4b6ff58f30a4ca5f02aa4061afa98.png\" alt=\"滿月\"></p>\n<h3>雨水與濺水</h3>\n<p>原版</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/484972758d34ce6c8794ab9869d16d6ba4109ef6_0.webp\" alt=\"原版雨景\"></p>\n<p>Lucid Sky</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b3ca6dd7a7b82c0e84a087b67e5848aee21ac605_0.webp\" alt=\"Lucid Sky 雨景\"></p>\n<p>Lucid Sky + 光影 (MakeUp - Ultra Fast)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b7bce666ab49a2d60067d5e9b2922fd358df85c0_0.webp\" alt=\"Lucid Sky 光影雨景\"></p>",
